 space planning experts in Chhattarpur, Salon décor and styling services in Chhattarpur,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/chhattarpur/services-salon-interior-designer"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"As a premier salon interior designer in Chhattarpur, we specialize in creating spaces that combine elegance, comfort, and functionality. Your salon is more than just a place to offer services—it’s an experience for your clients. From the moment they step in, the ambiance\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Chhattarpur\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Chhattarpur\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/chhattarpur/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Salon Interior Designer in Chhattarpur\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/chhattarpur/services-salon-interior-designer\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does a salon interior designer in Chhattarpur plan for a new salon?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We plan the full floor: reception, waiting area, styling stations, wash basins, treatment rooms and storage. Plumbing, power points and lighting are fixed before any furniture is made, so the salon works smoothly from the first day.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can an existing salon be redesigned without closing it for long?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The work can be split into phases, for example treatment rooms first and the main floor later, so the salon keeps serving clients. We share the sequence and site plan before work starts.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why hire a salon specialist instead of only a contractor?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A salon interior designer thinks about client flow, mirror lighting, easy-to-clean finishes and staff movement, not only looks. These details decide how comfortable clients feel and how smoothly the team works through a busy day.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you take up salon projects outside Chhattarpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Along with Chhattarpur, we design salons across South Delhi, Gurgaon and the rest of Delhi NCR.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Salon Interior Designer in Chhattarpur, Delhi\",\"serviceType\":\"Salon Interior Designer\",\"description\":\"Looking for a salon interior designer in Chhattarpur? 9th Corner plans salon layouts, styling stations and lighting that keep clients coming back.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/chhattarpur/services-salon-interior-designer\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Chhattarpur, Delhi\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/project/star-salon/12.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Salon Interior Designer in Chhattarpur, Delhi</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Salon Design for Chhattarpur's Main Roads and Markets</h2>\n            <p>As a salon interior designer in Chhattarpur, Delhi, we create salon interiors that reflect your brand, attract clients, and enhance staff efficiency. Our designs balance style with functionality to create luxurious, modern, and inviting spaces. From high-end hair studios to serene spa retreats, we ensure your space becomes a destination for beauty and relaxation.</p>\n            <p>Salons in Chhattarpur serve two very different crowds. Families from Chhattarpur Enclave and the nearby colonies want a reliable local place for haircuts and grooming, while the farmhouse wedding season brings a steady stream of bridal and party bookings. A salon interior designer working here has to plan for both, often on the same floor.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Customized Salon Designs</h2>\n            <p>\"We design reception areas, styling zones, treatment rooms, and lounges with meticulous attention to aesthetics, ergonomics, and client experience. Every detail is crafted to create a professional yet welcoming salon environment that optimizes workflow and delights every visitor.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Salons on Busy Main Roads</h3>\n                <p>Shops along Chhattarpur Main Road and the MG Road stretch face dust, traffic noise and strong afternoon sun. We use sealed glazing, a small entry lobby and blinds that cut glare without hiding the salon from the street.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Bridal and Makeup Studios</h3>\n                <p>With so many wedding venues nearby, makeup and bridal work can be a big share of income. A salon interior designer plans a separate makeup room with shadow-free lighting, a large mirror, a changing area and a corner where the finished look can be photographed. Lehengas and jewellery need safe hanging and storage space too.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Planning Around the Working Day</h3>\n                <p>Mornings are slow and evenings are packed, so the layout must handle peak hours without chaos. We separate the waiting area from the stations, keep the wash zone close to the colour bar and give staff a short, direct route to the store room. Power points are planned for dryers, straighteners and steamers running together, with a dedicated circuit so the lights do not dip.</p><p><b>Efficient Layouts:</b> Strategic salon floor plans that maximize space utilization while ensuring smooth movement for both staff and clients.</p><p><b>Modern Décor:</b> Curation of contemporary furniture and premium décor elements that elevate the visual appeal and status of your salon.</p><p><b>Experience Focused:</b> A salon interior designer applies human-centric design principles to enhance the client journey, from the reception desk to the styling chair.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Steps to Opening Day</h3>\n                <p>We first visit the shop and check the ceiling height, water line, drainage and electrical load. Our salon interior designer team then prepares a layout and 3D views, followed by a cost estimate you can compare line by line.</p><p>Work on site covers civil changes, plumbing for basins, wiring, false ceiling, furniture, mirrors and signboards. A written schedule lets you plan hiring and launch offers around a real date.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Work With Us as Your Salon Interior Designer?</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>We know that a salon is a business first. Every design choice is checked against two questions: will it bring clients in, and will it make the staff faster?</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Experts in Salon and Spa Interiors</strong>\n                    Hands-on work with salon floors, spas and makeup rooms.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Tailored Solutions for Brand and Workflow</strong>\n                    Your brand look and daily routine planned together.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>End-to-End Project Execution and Delivery</strong>\n                    Design, site work and setup handled by one team.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Ready for Wedding Season</strong>\n                    Bridal rooms that handle back-to-back bookings.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Backup Power Planned</strong>\n                    Key lights and tools stay on during cuts.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Elevate your brand with a space that inspires beauty. Partner with Chhattarpur's premier salon design experts to create your dream studio today.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects Near Chhattarpur</h2>\n                <p>Interiors we have completed in Saket, Green Park and Gurgaon, all within easy reach of Chhattarpur.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-sachin-saket/mr-sachin-saket/2.avif\" alt=\"Home interior project in Saket, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Saket Home Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/mr-virend-singh-gurga