team works through a busy day.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you take up salon projects outside Chhattarpur?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Along with Chhattarpur, we design salons across South Delhi, Gurgaon and the rest of Delhi NCR.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Give Your Clients a Reason to Choose You</h2>\n            <p>There is no shortage of salons on Chhattarpur's roads. A good salon interior designer helps yours look different from the first glance and run smoothly behind the scenes.</p><p>Planning a new salon or a makeover? <a href=\"/chhattarpur/contact\">Call or message 9th Corner</a> and we will visit your shop to discuss ideas.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}